      "writtenOn": "2023-04-07T21:07:06Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "WDYT about making `b` the last child, and swapping `d` and `s` here and in `SkShaders::Blend` factory? This would have the RuntimeEffectBlock\u0027s children be identical to that required for `BlendShaderBlock`.\n\nIt would also mean we could structure this precompile factory like:\n\n    if (desiredBlendCombination \u003e fSeparableModeIndex) {\n       RuntimeEffectBlock // hopefully to be consolidated into the else branch\n    } else {\n       BlendShaderBlock \n    }\n    \n    AddToKey(fSrcOptions)\n    AddToKey(fDstOptions)\n    \n    // here the first if and else-if match the precompile equivalent to the \n    // proposed SkBlendModeBlender::addToKey\n    if (combo \u003d\u003d porterDuff)\n        CoeffBlenderBlock\n    else if (combo \u003d\u003d separable)\n        BlendModeBlenderBlock\n    else\n        AddToKey\u003cPrecompileBlender\u003e(fRuntimeBlendEffects)",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 172,
        "startChar": 20,
        "endLine": 172,
        "endChar": 40
      },
      "revId": "3899307a252ce270745133d5483b062b41ad9d48",
