      "message": "I think this needs to be \n\n    BlendShaderBlock\n        PriorOutputBlock\n        PrimitiveCOlorBlock\n        fPrimitiveBlender-\u003eaddToKey()\n    end\n    \nThis should be ok if we move the blend mode and coeff logic back to SkBlendModeBlender::addToKey.",
